1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,569
Apatah lagi silaturahim.

2
00:00:02,569 --> 00:00:04,010
Silaturahim apa dia?

3
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:07,000
Hubungan rahim, hubungan keluarga.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,700
Anak dengan mak itu silaturahim.

5
00:00:14,038 --> 00:00:16,776
Adik-beradik silaturahim.

6
00:00:17,114 --> 00:00:20,000
Sepupu sepapat itu silaturahim.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,710
Itu dia silaturahim.

8
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:25,110
Dengan kawan-kawan

9
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:28,628
ini ukhuwah, berkawan.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,970
Tapi dengan ahli keluarga silaturahim.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Nabi SAW bersabda,

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,579
man kana yu'minu billahi wal yaumil

13
00:00:38,579 --> 00:00:39,684
akhir falyasil rahimah.

14
00:00:39,684 --> 00:00:41,510
Barang siapa yang beriman dengan

15
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:42,645
Allah dan hari akhirat, hendaklah

16
00:00:42,645 --> 00:00:45,000
dia merapatkan silaturahim.

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,200
Menghubungkan

18
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,030
silaturahim.

19
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Buatlah.

20
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:53,000
Jangan teori-teori saja.

21
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Berteori saja.

22
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,280
Nak buat itu, nak buat ini,

23
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,000
haram dia buat.

24
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Orang dia buat, haram nak datang.

25
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Buat.

26
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Buat.

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,980
Jangan cakap banyak-banyak.

28
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Buat.

29
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,170
Ada kita bergaduh dengan

30
00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:12,430
siapa-siapa, pergi minta maaf.

31
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,210
Mana tahu mati esok-esok.

32
00:01:17,210 --> 00:01:20,970
Kadang-kadang mak dengan anak bergaduh.

33
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Silaturahim ini wajib kita jaga.

34
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Nabi kata apa?

35
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,000
La yadkhulul jannata qati'.

36
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,880
Tak masuk syurga orang yang

37
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,890
memutuskan silaturahim.

38
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,660
Buang dendam kesumat,

39
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:38,500
buang.

40
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,340
Biar kita selesaikan urusan kita

41
00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:43,000
dengan semua orang.
